  "description": "Dive into the world of Plants vs. Zombies™ - available for free download and straightforward installation. Completely safe, containing no viruses or malware. Always get the latest version effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "Get ready for an exhilarating zombie onslaught in this captivating and fast-paced game! With a selection of 49 unique plants at your disposal, including peashooters, cherry bombs, and wall-nuts, you’ll find numerous strategies to fend off the wave of zombies attempting to invade your home. Tackle 50 thrilling levels in Adventure mode, and test your endurance in Survival mode. Keep in mind that each zombie possesses its own distinct skills and tricks. Gather coins to acquire power-ups and even a companion snail to help you in your battle against the undead. Demonstrate your prowess and achieve achievements as you become more powerful in this exciting showdown of plants versus zombies.",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Utilize the powers of 49 unique plants to combat the zombie hordes",
    "Complete 50 stages in Adventure mode and aim for the highest survival time in Survival mode",
    "Encounters with 26 different zombie types, each with special skills",
    "Strategically plan your moves using the Almanac to gather information about zombies and plants",
    "Collect coins to buy power-ups and a helpful pet snail for your journey"
